# Raw input: Ultra high resolution monochrome photograph capturing the Teton mountain range in Ansel Adams' iconic style, showcasing the dramatic peaks of the Grand Teton National Park during golden hour. The composition centers on the snow-capped summits piercing a deep blue sky, with the valley below filled by the glassy expanse of Jackson Lake reflecting the mountains' silhouettes. Sharp details reveal rough granite textures in the foreground ridges, intricate patterns of glacial ice on the slopes, and the smooth, waveless surface of the lake. High-contrast lighting creates stark chiaroscuro effects: pure white snow glints under the sun, while deep blacks define the shadowed crevices of the jagged peaks. The mood is serene yet monumental, evoking timeless solitude and natural grandeur. Textures are rendered with photographic precision—crisp edges on the snow, velvety smoothness of the lake, and coarse grain of the exposed rock. Artistic style features Adams' signature high-contrast black-and-white composition, meticulous framing, and cinematic depth. Quality tags: 8K resolution, photorealistic, ultra-detailed, cinematic lighting, dynamic range, sharp focus, naturalist photography, documentary realism, monochrome masterwork.
